WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:04,530
The money is not for you.

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:06,030
I don't believe I can't beat him

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Why is this guy so strong?

4
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,520
Get out of here

5
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:17,090
Can't beat him

6
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,290
I still can't get you

7
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:20,310
I'm being treated like a weakling

8
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:27,010
God's legs are alive and well, Brother Tiger

9
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,410
You flew away with one kick

10
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:31,160
I didn't want to do anything, brother

11
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,060
We won't fight

12
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,940
Who wants to shake hands with you?

13
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:41,990
Driving a Land Rover so far at night
